:INFO
Art. 55 Referendum and commencement
1 This Act shall be subject to an optional referendum.
2 The Federal Council shall set the commencement date.
Commencement date: 1 August 2005Art. 19 para. 2 let. a and d, 34 para. 1 let. e, 38, 49 para. 3 let. e and Annex No II 2 (Art. 39 para. 1bis of the Environmental Protection Act): 1 January 2005
